---------------------------------
Copyright holder: Copyright (C) 2026 Tencent. Author: Tencent Inc.
License: Apache License 2.0.

Location and use: vendor/cubesandbox-sdk-0.3.0+pr1485+bytes.tgz. The
gateway uses this package to create and reclaim CubeSandbox sandboxes.

Origin: built from the sdk/node tree of TencentCloud/CubeSandbox at
revision 9c4837ec, with the change from
https://github.com/TencentCloud/CubeSandbox/pull/1485, and a second
change in this tree: files.read honours format: 'bytes' and returns a
Uint8Array instead of decoding the file as UTF-8.

This is a modified version of the upstream package. The modifications
are that commands.run no longer sends a Connect-Timeout-Ms header that
has already expired, and that files.read can return a file's bytes
unaltered. Apache License 2.0 section 4(b) requires that these
modifications be stated prominently.

